          "code": "SUMMARIZE_DATA",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1768143481763",
          "id": "1767949784867",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1767949784870_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "#Input\n{{$context.$nodes.FETCH_SUPPLIER_RESPONSES.$output.output}} \n#Role\nYou are a Supplier Bids and RFQ Tracking analyst. Examine the provided input, which is an array of bids gathered from all RFQs  Each entry may include:\nItem number\nSupplier\nNegotiation (which is RFQ)\nQuote\nLead Time\nYield %\nCompliant\nTooling Cost\nTariffs\n#Guidelines\nProvide a brief, business-formal summary (1Ã¢â‚¬â€œ2 sentences, under 50 words) highlighting key insights, supplier recommendations for Items. Place this summary immediately before the component table.\nFor each component, display only these columns: Item, Supplier,RFQ, Quote, Lead Time, Yield %,Compliant, Tooling Cost, Tariffs, Status\nIf any data is missing, use \"0\".\nShow results as a formatted multiRecord display.\n- Format Quote as US Dollars\n- Show Compliant as color chip, Green for compliance, blue for Exempt or NA. If it's empty or not present, show \"Not Present\" in red.\n- Add an additional row Status - which shows Preferred, Alternate and Review. You need to analyze the data and self assign Peferred for a part. Use colour chips here\n\n#Output format\nA formatted multiRecord showing the specified columns for each component, preceded by your summary."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "errorNodeId": "1778145291814",
            "name": "Fetch Supplier Responses",
            "workflowCode": "ORA_SUPPLIER_BID_RETRIEVER"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1768143272871"
          },
          "code": "FETCH_SUPPLIER_RESPONSES",
          "id": "1768460537103",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1771505142816_1",
              "name": "message",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "{{$context.$nodes.EXTRACT_ITEM_AND_ORG.$output.result.BillSequenceId}}"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"input\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"output\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"null\"\n    },\n    \"followUpQuestions\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"jobId\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"conversationId\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"traceId\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"status\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"supportingChunks\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {}\n    },\n    \"citations\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {}\n    },\n    \"nodes\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {}\n    },\n    \"waitingToolCode\": {\n      \"type\": \"null\"\n    },\n    \"workflowCode\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"workflowVersion\": {\n      \"type\": \"integer\"\n    },\n    \"workflowStatus\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"startDate\": {\n      \"type\": \"integer\"\n    },\n    \"endTime\": {\n      \"type\": \"integer\"\n    },\n    \"createDate\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"endDate\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"timeTaken\": {\n      \"type\": \"integer\"\n    },\n    \"inputTokenCount\": {\n      \"type\": \"integer\"\n    },\n    \"outputTokenCount\": {\n      \"type\": \"integer\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": []\n}",
          "type": "WORKFLOW"
